--
--   TwoForm, CoVec, raise2, fieldSq, ricciScalar, emStress, einsteinMaxwell (E), maxwellDiv (J), faradayCyclic (H), extD. Residuals (registered H1–H8, 4D): E_ab = R_ab − ½ g_ab R − 2 S_ab with R = Σ g^{ab} R_ab and S_ab = Σ_{c,d} F_ac g^{cd} F_bd − ¼ g_ab F_cd F^{cd} (F^{ab} = Σ g^{ac} g^{bd} F_cd, raised with the given ginv); J^b = Σ_a (∂_a F^{ab} + Σ_k (Γ^a_{ak} F^{kb} + Γ^b_{ak} F^{ak})) (an upper-index vector); H_abc = ∂_a F_bc + ∂_b F_ca + ∂_c F_ab (a covariant 3-index quantity). E is a covariant 2-index quantity.
